==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2~20 seconds<sup>60f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8~40 seconds<sup>240f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~12 seconds<sup>200f~360f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
**11 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Farm as much money as possible during the initial Baa Baa wave. Bring long-ranged attackers such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to take down Gory Dark and Angelic Gory. To deal with Le’boin, use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] to attack safely from the backline.

[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] is also a good alternative meatshield against Angel enemies.

